      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "**Extend a video**\n\n1. The first **HashBidX Video** box makes a clip.\n2. **Extend / Edit Clip** continues it: its prompt says what happens next. The line from **task_id** to **source_task_id** tells it which clip to continue.\n3. Press **Run**. The box on the right plays both parts as one clip.\n\nTo extend again, add another **Extend / Edit Clip** box and connect it the same way. An extension is charged for the new seconds and for reading the source clip.\n\n**First time?** Paste your HashBidX key into the **HashBidX API Key** box above and click **Verify and save key**. The box then shows the last four characters of the saved key, and every template is ready to run."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "**Extend a video**\n\n1. The first **HashBidX Video** box makes a clip.\n2. **Extend / Edit Clip** continues it: its prompt says what happens next. The line from **task_id** to **source_task_id** tells it which clip to continue.\n3. Press **Run**. The box on the right plays both parts as one clip.\n\nTo extend again, add another **Extend / Edit Clip** box and connect it the same way. An extension is charged for the new seconds and for reading the source clip.\n\n**First time?** Paste your HashBidX key into the **HashBidX API Key** box above and click **Verify and save key**. The box then shows the last four characters of the saved key, and every template is ready to run."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
